# Casting: do_cast's refusals, each kind of target, the words a caster utters, and losing concentration. Only
# area_update runs. At the entrance to Mud School (3700, not a lawful room): Smokegod (60, a mage, with every skill at
# 100 and mana to spare), Cherub (52, a mage, who knows no spells until Smokegod sets them, and hears their names)
# and Decimus (10, a warrior, who hears the garbled words). Heroic (51, a warrior, every skill at 100) casts at 3/4
# of his level, as his class has no mana. A cast makes the caster wait, which the scenario waits out.
# - no spell named, a spell not known, a skill that isn't a spell, asleep, resting
# - offensive: no one fought, no one here, a target safe from Cherub (Decimus, in no clan; Smokegod's trust is past
#   that rule), and a drunk who attacks back
# - defensive (yourself by default), self only (on another), an object carried or not, an object or a character
# - with every skill at 1, Heroic loses his concentration, spending half the mana
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
goto 3700
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
transfer cherub 3700
transfer decimus 3700
transfer heroic 3700
set skill heroic all 100
@as dec
cast
cast armor
cast bash
@as cher
cast fly
@as god
set skill cherub all 100
@as cher
cast 'acid blast' decimus
@as god
cast
cast nonesuch
cast kick
cast 'acid blast'
cast 'acid blast' nobody
cast armor
@pulse 24
cast armor nobody
cast armor decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'detect invis' decimus
@pulse 24
cast fireproof
cast fireproof nothing
@obj 3021 3700
cast fireproof sword
get sword
cast fireproof sword
@pulse 24
cast curse
cast curse nothing
cast curse decimus
cast curse sword
@pulse 24
cast bless sword
@pulse 24
cast bless
@pulse 24
@as hero
cast armor
@pulse 24
cast fly smokegod
cast fly
@pulse 24
@as god
sleep
cast armor
wake
rest
cast armor
stand
@mob 3064 3700
cast 'chill touch' drunk
@pulse 24
@state
set skill heroic all 1
@as hero
cast armor decimus
@pulse 24
cast fly decimus
@pulse 24
cast 'detect evil' decimus
@pulse 24
@state
